#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:15
msgid "Default embed mode"
msgstr "Mode d'incrustació predeterminat"

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:16
msgid ""
"Controls what the player shows around the archived content. \"Default\" "
"shows the full player interface, with a browser-like address bar and the "
"archive's pages list. \"Full\" adds the ReplayWeb.page navigation bar (with "
"logo) above that interface. \"Replay only\" shows just the archived page "
"with no controls, and requires a starting URL to be meaningful. \"Replay "
"with info\" shows just the archived page plus a collapsible bar that reveals"
" archive details, including a download link, the original URL, the date "
"archived, and the file size."
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:21
msgid "Replay only"
msgstr "Només reproducció"

#: Module.php:22
msgid "Replay with info"
msgstr "Reproducció amb informació"

#: Module.php:160
msgid ""
"Enter the original URL of the page to open first. Leave blank to show the "
"archive's pages list, where viewers can browse all captured pages. Required "
"if embed mode is set to \"Replay only\"."
msgstr ""
"Introduïu l'URL original de la pàgina que s'ha d'obrir primer. Deixeu-ho en "
"blanc per mostrar la llista de pàgines de l'arxiu, des d'on els usuaris "
"poden navegar per totes les pàgines capturades. És obligatori si el mode "
"d'incrustació està definit com a «Només reproducció»."

#: Module.php:166
msgid ""
"Controls what the player shows around the archived content. \"Default\" "
"shows the full player interface, with a browser-like address bar and the "
"archive's pages list. \"Full\" adds the ReplayWeb.page navigation bar (with "
"logo) above that interface. \"Replay only\" shows just the archived page "
"with no controls, and requires a starting URL to be meaningful. \"Replay "
"with info\" shows just the archived page plus a collapsible bar that reveals"
" archive details, including a download link, the original URL, the date "
"archived, and the file size. Leave blank to use the site default."
msgstr ""
